  "notes": [
    "Low-side switch from a GPIO: emitter to GND, load from the supply to the collector, base through 1-4.7 kohm (for saturation, base current about a tenth of the load current: 3.3 V logic, 1 kohm gives 2.6 mA for loads to about 50 mA).",
    "Add 10-100 kohm base to emitter when the driving pin may float; a flyback diode (1N4148W) across relay coils.",
    "Complement: MMBT3906."
